# PART 1 — REPORTING PLATFORM FOUNDATION & ENTERPRISE CONTRACT

## 1. Document Purpose

`SP-210_reporting_platform.md` mendefinisikan foundation, enterprise contract, architectural boundary, responsibility model, functional scope, non-functional requirements, data principles, security principles, extensibility requirements, serta governance prerequisites untuk **Reporting Platform** pada ekosistem VENTRA.

Reporting Platform merupakan platform enterprise yang bertanggung jawab menyediakan kemampuan pelaporan yang:

- konsisten;
- terukur;
- auditable;
- secure;
- scalable;
- reusable;
- tenant-aware;
- role-aware;
- permission-aware;
- traceable;
- extensible;
- AI-ready;
- dan suitable untuk kebutuhan operasional, manajerial, executive, finance, CRM, booking, marketing, jamaah, vendor, supplier, serta domain enterprise lainnya.

Reporting Platform **BUKAN** sekadar kumpulan halaman laporan.

Reporting Platform harus diperlakukan sebagai **enterprise reporting capability** yang memiliki contract, lifecycle, governance, data lineage, access control, query boundary, rendering strategy, export capability, auditability, observability, dan extensibility yang terdefinisi secara eksplisit.

