# 3. Reporting Platform Definition

Reporting Platform adalah platform enterprise yang menyediakan mekanisme terstandarisasi untuk mengubah data terkontrol menjadi informasi yang dapat digunakan oleh:

- operational users;
- administrators;
- finance teams;
- marketing teams;
- sales teams;
- CRM teams;
- booking teams;
- customer service teams;
- management;
- executives;
- auditors;
- system administrators;
- authorized external users;
- AI agents;
- dan authorized enterprise consumers lainnya.

Reporting Platform harus mampu menangani berbagai bentuk output, termasuk namun tidak terbatas pada:

- operational reports;
- analytical reports;
- management reports;
- executive reports;
- financial reports;
- customer reports;
- jamaah reports;
- booking reports;
- package reports;
- payment reports;
- vendor reports;
- supplier reports;
- marketing reports;
- performance reports;
- audit reports;
- compliance reports;
- system reports;
- scheduled reports;
- dashboard datasets;
- machine-readable datasets;
- AI-consumable reporting datasets.

---

# 4. Core Principle

Reporting Platform harus mengikuti prinsip:

> **One Reporting Contract, Multiple Reporting Consumers.**

Satu definisi laporan harus dapat digunakan oleh berbagai consumer tanpa menduplikasi business logic.

Consumer dapat berupa:

- web dashboard;
- mobile application;
- desktop application;
- API consumer;
- export engine;
- scheduled delivery;
- notification service;
- AI agent;
- analytics service;
- audit service;
- enterprise integration.

Business logic laporan **tidak boleh** diduplikasi pada setiap consumer.

---

